{"sentences":[{"id":"s_work_clt_239_1","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_239","textTraditional":"一、十有一年，春，齊國書帥師伐我。","sentenceOrder":1},{"id":"s_work_clt_239_2","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_239","textTraditional":"二、夏，陳轅頗出奔鄭。","sentenceOrder":2},{"id":"s_work_clt_239_3","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_239","textTraditional":"三、五月，公會吳伐齊。甲戌，齊國書帥師及吳戰於艾陵。齊師敗績，獲齊國書。","sentenceOrder":3},{"id":"s_work_clt_239_4","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_239","textTraditional":"四、秋，七月，辛酉，滕子虞母卒。","sentenceOrder":4},{"id":"s_work_clt_239_5","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_239","textTraditional":"五、冬，十有一月，葬滕隱公。","sentenceOrder":5},{"id":"s_work_clt_239_6","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_239","textTraditional":"六、衞世叔齊出奔宋。","sentenceOrder":6}],"overrides":{}}